#. type: Hash Value: workshops description
#: _data/workshops.yaml:1
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "A Developer Sandbox-based workshop. The workshop uses Eclipse Che to develop Quarkus apps and deploy them to a Kubernetes cluster (based on OpenShift). It does not require local setup, but does require external services to be provisioned."
msgstr "一个基于开发者沙箱的工作坊。该工作坊使用 Eclipse Che 开发 Quarkus 应用，并将它们部署到 Kubernetes 集群（基于 OpenShift）中。该工作坊无需本地环境配置，但需要预先配置外部服务。"

